d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://maximjdev.itch.io/nature-hike#comments\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" aria-hidden fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://maximjdev.itch.io/nature-hike/devlog\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" aria-hidden fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/5036178/nature-hike\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" aria-hidden fill=\"none\" width=\"18\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_very_large family_patrick-hand\"><div id=\"header\" class=\"header align_center has_image\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwMTU2MjQ4LmpwZw==/original/g889Rt.jpg\" alt=\"Nature Hike\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Nature Hike</h1></div><div itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" id=\"view_game_7244509\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows, macOS, and Linux</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a class=\"button buy_btn\" href=\"https://maximjdev.itch.io/nature-hike/purchase\">Buy Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span itemprop=\"price\" class=\"dollars\">$2.00 USD</span> <span class=\"sub\">or more</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><em>Where will the trail lead you? Join your new friend Tendou on a hiking date and find out in this short and sweet fully voice-acted Visual Novel!</em></p>\r\n<p><br>You&#x27;d never have imagined yourself going on a day-long hiking date, much less with local tanuki hunk and recent friend Tendou Ishikawa! You had no idea he felt that way about you, and you barely knew you felt that way about him... but you&#x27;re looking forward to finding out what awaits at the end of the journey.<br><br></p>\r\n<h2>A short and sweet cozy visual novel! </h2>\r\n<ul><li>Each hiking route takes just about 30 minutes, with a total gameplay time of 1-2 hours depending on your reading speed.\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<h2>Unforgettable voice-acting!&nbsp;</h2>\r\n<ul><li>Tendou&#x27;s a total dreamboat, and who could be better furry boyfriend material than Sean Chiplock himself?! His soft bass and his charming, vulnerable delivery will immerse you completely in the date.&nbsp;\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<h2>Hilarious yet&nbsp;poignant writing!</h2>\r\n<ul><li>From the Maxi that brought you The Hayseed Knight comes: more romance, more comedy, and just a hint of human drama to tie up this adorable little experience.\r\n</li></ul>\r\n<h2>Absolutely gorgeous art!</h2>\r\n<ul><li>I don&#x27;t think I need to tell you how good JEIBON&#x27;s art is, but SHE DESERVES TO HEAR IT ALL THE SAME! &nbsp;</li></ul>\r\n<h2>Super&nbsp;chill&nbsp;OST!</h2>\r\n<ul><li>You won&#x27;t stop&nbsp;nodding along the relaxing beats that elevate every scene thanks to Tancla&#x27;s country-pop inspired&nbsp;guitar score.\r\n</li></ul></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg aria-hidden width=\"12\" version=\"1.1\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_9435366\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"30 September 2026 @ 12:34 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 6 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"23 September 2026 @ 15:01 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 13 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-windows\">Windows</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-osx\">macOS</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/platform-linux\">Linux</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div data-tooltip=\"4.40 average rating from 5 total ratings\" tabindex=\"0\" itemscope itemtype=\"h